"santizhu-e-p039c","title":"孙皓诛杀李勖并焚其尸","accounts":[{"id":"santizhu-a-20e85a7ccd17fde5b86a","label":"裴注·江表传","text":"孙皓诛杀李勖并焚其尸","evidence":["santizhu-q-eefb9ecc1eaab8736837"]}],"participants":[{"person":"shaodi-p0162","role":"命诛李勖并焚尸","evidence":["santizhu-q-eefb9ecc1eaab8736837"]},{"person":"luxun-p0070","role":"被诛者","evidence":["santizhu-q-eefb9ecc1eaab8736837"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"原文纪年见引文；不换算公元年","precision":"undated","basis":"本批仅记录原文时间表达，不由相邻纪年推算公元年。","evidence":["santizhu-q-eefb9ecc1eaab8736837"]},"ordering_evidence":"santizhu-q-eefb9ecc1eaab8736837","source_order":[48,39,98],"order":8822}],"persons":[{"id":"luxun-p0070","name":"李勖","evidence":["luxun-q-o076","santizhu-q-271fd58ce4bc07876cf3","santizhu-q-b8237561d943bacea3fd","santizhu-q-6f079f75c547f16f6383","santizhu-q-4558be81461365b4e08c","santizhu-q-08b0b1f0f7d19661eaf3","santizhu-q-7ff108ffdb77de6bb081","santizhu-q-eefb9ecc1eaab8736837"],"facts":[],"aliases":[],"mentions":[{"id":"luxun-m-o076-luxun-p0070","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["luxun-q-o076"]}]}],"evidence":[{"id":"luxun-q-o076","section":"chapter-058","block":"b-11441c73cfeb9b85407b","layer":"original","quote":"闻武昌左部督薛莹，征下狱〖1〗，抗上疏曰：“夫俊乂者〖2〗，国家之良宝，社稷之贵资；庶政所以伦叙〖3〗，四门所以穆清也〖4〗。故大司农楼玄、散骑中常侍王蕃、少府李勖〖5〗，皆当世秀颖，一时显器；既蒙初宠，从容列位〖6〗；而并旋受诛殛，或圮族替祀〖7〗，或投弃荒裔。盖《周礼》有赦贤之辟〖8〗，《春秋》有宥善之义〖9〗。《书》曰：‘与其杀不辜〖10〗，宁失不经〖11〗。’而蕃等罪名未定，大辟已加〖12〗；心经忠义，身被极刑：岂不痛哉！且已死之刑〖13〗，固无所识〖14〗；至乃焚烁流漂，弃之水滨：惧非先王之正典，或甫侯之所戒也〖15〗。是以百姓哀耸，士民同戚。蕃、勖永已，悔亦靡及〖16〗；诚望陛下，赦召玄出。而顷闻薛莹，猝见逮录〖17〗。莹父综，纳言先帝〖18〗，傅弼文皇〖19〗。及莹承基，内厉名行；今之所坐〖20〗，罪在可宥。臣惧有司，未详其事；如复诛戮，益失民望。乞垂天恩，原赦莹罪；哀矜庶狱〖21〗，清澄刑网〖22〗。则天下幸甚！”","section_title":"陆逊传第十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0123.xhtml","index":378,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":421},{"id":"santizhu-q-08b0b1f0f7d19661eaf3","section":"chapter-048","block":"b-4a94fbfb17c35295d445","layer":"original","quote":"勖及徐存家属皆伏诛","section_title":"三嗣主传第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0103.xhtml","index":397,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":43,"end":52},{"id":"santizhu-q-271fd58ce4bc07876cf3","section":"chapter-048","block":"b-0480c5aebff66afe1ffb","layer":"original","quote":"遣监军虞汜、威南将军薛珝、苍梧太守陶璜由荆州〖1〗；监军李勖、督军徐存从建安海道〖2〗：皆就合浦，击交阯","section_title":"三嗣主传第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0103.xhtml","index":395,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":21,"end":73},{"id":"santizhu-q-4558be81461365b4e08c","section":"chapter-048","block":"b-4a94fbfb17c35295d445","layer":"original","quote":"殿中列将何定曰〖6〗：“少府李勖枉杀冯斐〖7〗，擅撤军退还。”","section_title":"三嗣主传第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0103.xhtml","index":397,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":12,"end":43},{"id":"santizhu-q-6f079f75c547f16f6383","section":"chapter-048","block":"b-15709b8033f18bc2572a","layer":"original","quote":"引军还","section_title":"三嗣主传第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0103.xhtml","index":396,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":35,"end":38},{"id":"santizhu-q-7ff108ffdb77de6bb081","section":"chapter-048","block":"b-98a4a0886ab49c6852d9","layer":"pei","quote":"定为子求少府李勖女，不许。定挟忿，谮勖于皓","attribution":"裴注·江表传","section_title":"三嗣主传第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0103.xhtml","index":451,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-f591d97ba67974d4ecc7","start":76,"end":97},{"id":"santizhu-q-b8237561d943bacea3fd","section":"chapter-048","block":"b-15709b8033f18bc2572a","layer":"original","quote":"李勖以建安道不通利〖4〗，杀导将冯斐〖5〗","section_title":"三嗣主传第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0103.xhtml","index":396,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":13,"end":34},{"id":"santizhu-q-eefb9ecc1eaab8736837","section":"chapter-048","block":"b-98a4a0886ab49c6852d9","layer":"pei","quote":"皓尺口诛之，焚其尸","attribution":"裴注·江表传","section_title":"三嗣主传第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0103.xhtml","index":451,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-f591d97ba67974d4ecc7","start":98,"end":107}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
